{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6471df81feac9db39deb875827bde2226cf4a0f6d888fcd327d9388b0bb9b30c", "ja": "（翼の新しい衣装が届いた。いつもと違う\nテイストだけど、本人は気に入ってくれただろうか？）", "zh": "（翼的新服装送到了。虽然风格和平时不一样，不知道她本人会不会喜欢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "cd458cb9dfd5759822ff2dfd26c5471efc69d2520da2f4552a042276d7750617", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。\n衣装、着てみたんですけど……どうですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n我试着穿了下这套服装……怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1002_p", "source_sha256": "52548ce331cfe43d1463ad9c4782a56073383fd15e74667fe50f0b603ed4c2b9", "ja": "（あれ？　なんだか翼がいつもと違うような……。\n衣装のせいか？　それとも気のせいか……？）", "zh": "（咦？总觉得翼好像和平时不太一样……\n是服装的原因吗？还是我多心了……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "66355672785b6cfd7085342f80a574bfc4604da5cfded739f6c808109da59ff0", "ja": "それで、いきなりなんですけど……\nこの後、わたしと一緒にデートしませんか？", "zh": "那么，虽然有点突然……\n接下来要不要和我一起约会？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1004_p", "source_sha256": "cb879de59d42b397d727dac1e94925f8a0e16a504c76a3b730ea1a0b29518f42", "ja": "ん？　デート？　本当にいきなりだな……。\n提案は嬉しいけど、まだ仕事が残っててな。", "zh": "嗯？约会？还真是够突然的……\n虽然你的提议让我很高兴，但我这边还有工作没做完呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2acd08bda4edeae9492ab5267db4a9b4ed87d4c31bb2447966d940d5853fb239", "ja": "え～、ダメなんですか？\n……むー、今回はうまく行くと思ったのになぁ～。", "zh": "诶～，不行吗？\n……唔～，我还以为这次能顺利呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1006_p", "source_sha256": "888b383838843fa4404f11cd9aca47eb905ddd98adf4793ea759343c47027d37", "ja": "ん……？　うまくって、どういうことだ？", "zh": "嗯……？顺利是指怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "18fd8ac2f9c2b82c1010c8f51ce6b5031a403093c3d5a7c11f4bc34f6f4c1490", "ja": "あれ、声に出てました？　……えっと、\n今日のわたし、いつもと違うところありませんか？", "zh": "咦，我刚才说出来了吗？……那个，\n今天的我，有没有什么和平时不一样的地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c89e3e46ab58d74fe9945dc8e5ebfab3d2711de39a09d17006687d254266a499", "ja": "いつもと違うところ？\nなんとなく、雰囲気が違うなとは思ったけど……。", "zh": "和平时不一样的地方？\n总觉得气氛确实有点不同就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ff990a8f73fa0739787791f2bd1c079fc94de6ab5a7198dece510295dddece4c", "ja": "もう、全然違います！　髪型ですよ、髪型！\n衣装に合わせて、ちょっとだけ変えてみたんです！", "zh": "真是的，完全不对啦！是发型，发型！\n为了配合服装，稍微调整了一下啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fa43eabab6020a315c07b19e815cab8c27f60f2d7bc03a36625672c0113489f7", "ja": "衣装が落ち着いた感じじゃないですか？　だから\n雑誌とかネットで調べてみたんです。そしたら……。", "zh": "这套服装不是给人一种沉稳的感觉吗？所以我就在杂志和网上查了查。结果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "881c33b69ccb2c09afb2ca7ae0bd4cd3976ea0b65f7e27d527431ede5b9f45aa", "ja": "『いつもと違うイメージで彼をメロメロにしよう！』\nって特集を見つけて。……うまく行くと思ったのにな。", "zh": "“用和平时不一样的形象让他神魂颠倒！”\n我看到了这个专题……明明觉得能成功的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1012_p", "source_sha256": "06cf2adbbb760d36fcd43dd039fe3a36adab9dd1de99846d019b5fab9af02ce6", "ja": "ははっ、残念ながらメロメロではないな。\nでも明るい翼とのギャップで、ドキッとはしたかな。", "zh": "哈哈，很遗憾，还没到神魂颠倒的程度。  \n不过，和平时开朗的翼形成的反差，确实让我心头一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b7d84c61bca99e23e5aad66bdd4f811c28b9f8e34243ec7fe1dbdcadf3b6a09f", "ja": "えっ、ホントですか！？\n{$P$}さん、ドキッとしたの？", "zh": "诶，真的吗！？\n{$P$}先生，你心动了一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4aea6fe789116728df925341f7a4dd5a88b3bf055b14c2475b47a0aeb5b20ebf", "ja": "ああ。最初は衣装のせいかと思ったけど、\n意識的に変えたって聞いて、納得したよ。", "zh": "啊。一开始我还以为是服装的缘故，  \n听说是你特意改的，我就明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f533ed6a0c0915c6f9ead4055f67be8a5096af03b4b5a774965cbf5e076e99c7", "ja": "カワイイ衣装とは少し違うから、心配だったけど。\n気に入ってくれたみたいでよかった。", "zh": "虽然和可爱的服装不太一样，我还有点担心。\n不过，你好像很喜欢，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "decfc70236911e1d3d037f03885e7a953926789288be371ab1ca0fd2ccf6eee3", "ja": "心配しなくても、{$P$}さんが\n考えてくれる衣装を嫌いになんかなりませんよ？", "zh": "您不用担心，我怎么可能会讨厌{$P$}先生为我精心设计的服装呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "514732729b8cb4378dbc852a4dd3be1d50baf3e070f5d18a1a139ef32d8bc4fe", "ja": "わたしのこと、ちゃんと考えてくれてるって、\nわかるもん。この衣装だって、そうでしょ？", "zh": "因为我能感受到，\n你真的有好好替我着想呀。这套服装也是这样，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6b488861001b0ae487370b0a1a72d782608c0a9239d6ddc6e01c98295343050f", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。\nいつもとは違う翼の魅力が引き立つようにって……。", "zh": "啊，当然。\n就是为了衬托出与平时不同的翼的魅力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "837599b54c6760dde55c3c1dada91e9589e6ffd298043379cd47d75bc79d287d", "ja": "それなら、成功ですね♪　メロメロはムリだったけど、\nドキッとはしてくれましたから！", "zh": "那就算成功啦♪ 虽然没能让你神魂颠倒，  \n不过还是让你心头一跳了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1020_p", "source_sha256": "1c2208a9aeeeea52f0948bd0b350ef280e6829a33d6fa97d0495ba2794ef60f4", "ja": "うっ、確かにそうだな……。\nはあ～……翼、ご褒美は別の日でもいいかな？", "zh": "唔，确实是这样……  \n唉～……翼，奖励改天再给你，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bd9a6645937b7f8403f2dd33f759cbf16a7ba0dd665a715eb2690a3a8fbc660a", "ja": "わっ……やったやった～♪\nご褒美デート、楽しみだな～。", "zh": "哇……太棒了太棒了～♪\n好期待奖励约会啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3b1cb64cbf00fd490ef48889c88a1650416e2dfacd4b83d7173a3e5915eab22c", "ja": "あっ！　予定、ちゃんと教えてくださいね？\nわたしも、いつもより気合いいれちゃおっと♪", "zh": "啊！日程一定要好好告诉我哦？\n我也要比平时更加全力以赴啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0344_1023_p", "source_sha256": "2c3057af23121ce9ec9b01a9169a0c93b14aee8d92fb93b73faa5aabaad892a0", "ja": "（翼のギャップは、今後も多くの人を魅了するだろう。\n翼の魅力は底が見えない……これからも楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（翼的反差感今后一定还会吸引很多人吧。\n翼的魅力深不可测……真让人期待她今后的表现啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
